# Architecture (detail)

Same boundaries as **`dev-doctor.mdc` §2**. This file is for edits under `src/` and `src-tauri/`.

- Diagnostic rules: pure functions over `ProjectSnapshot`; one failed rule must not fail the scan.
- Rust snapshot and allowlist: `src-tauri/src/{snapshot,security,probe,chrome}.rs`. Commands in `lib.rs`.
- Copy and open-docs actions do not run shell commands.
- Verify: `npm test`, `npm run typecheck`, `cargo test --manifest-path src-tauri/Cargo.toml`.
